00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
[Wind and tram hum] Four women ride above Tegucigalpa as Ellie catches Radiance and gives her a quick cheek kiss.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[The tram banks] ECE glances back jealously while Alia shields her and Radiance reaches for Alia's hand.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,042
[Relieved laughter] The four link hands, circle together, and reconcile above the city.
